      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/g/65b543/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2012-04-19T01:43:08.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>That could work too.</p>\n<p>The only reason I suggested the person “running” the game send out the cards via pm was because these types of games can take a while and it would be easier for one person to track the decks.  This way the players can still feel free to use their real decks in face to face games and not have to worry about keeping a deck off to side to maintain their hand, discard, and draw decks.</p>",
