      "created_at": "2012-04-19T01:59:03.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Why not use a google doc to track each player’s deck? Allow anyone to view but only the players to edit.<br>\nThe deck compositions are already out in the wild so to speak so you could list the decks alphabetically and then just use a die roll server to roll a d40 every time you needed to draw a card. Using a spreadsheet to track where each card is and, if need be, which cards are on the bottom/top of each deck wouldn’t be hard.</p>",
